# Copy to .private-terms (gitignored). One extended regex per line, matched
# case-insensitively against every staged file and each commit message. Lines
# starting with # are ignored.
# List what must never appear in this public repo: your hostnames, IP ranges,
# key aliases, employer and client names, usernames, home-directory paths,
# session ids.
my-server\.example\.com
192\.168\.
/home/yourname/
sk-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,}
claude\.ai/code/session_
